      "text": "RI-DEC-06: native decision backend protocol and adapters, plus generative runner finalization without envelope conflation."
    },
    {
      "ref": "ReactiveInferenceSDK docs/programs/unified-decision-inference-2026-10-21/02-implementation.md:15@485f3615db1e",
      "text": "RI-DEC-07: strict result validator, abstention, atomic/partial batch semantics, retry/cancellation, transient errors and snapshot freshness."
    },
    {
      "ref": "ReactiveInferenceSDK docs/programs/unified-decision-inference-2026-10-21/02-implementation.md:23@485f3615db1e",
      "text": "Current implementation: RI-DEC-02/04/05 **initial restricted seed only**, with choice questions and pure preflight, NOT provider execution or advanced output support."
    },
